   "corrections": [],
   "notes": "M2G is a fully defined minimal medium; the only trace metal is EDTA-chelated FeSO4 (10 uM). The current_components list contained spurious Fe3+ (EX_fe3_e), Co2+, Cu2+, Mn2+ and Zn2+ that are NOT part of authentic M2/M2G (no cobalt, copper, manganese, zinc or ferric salt is added) -- these should be dropped as reconstruction defaults. Oxygen corrected from 'facultative' to 'aerobic' (C. crescentus is an obligate aerobe cultivated in shake flasks at 150 rpm). All concentrations added; sulfate now derives from MgSO4 (the paper's deliberate MgCl2->MgSO4 swap), which is central to this sulfur/gluta"
  },
